{
 "slug": "necs-entree-alternative",
 "pageId": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
 "text_batches": [
  [
   {
    "label": "t0",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "c3df870f-ba8c-9aaf-796c-bb1249eeefa3"
     },
     "text": "20-30 Min"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t1",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fe9d"
     },
     "text": "Saved on each order that skips the phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t2",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "3027ca32-6180-79a6-1a66-d9f911e27a08"
     },
     "text": "24-48 Hrs"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t3",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fea2"
     },
     "text": "Is the setup window for most distributors"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t4",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "448bf1fe-361f-3c13-6268-4572092953ba"
     },
     "text": "24/7"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t5",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5feac"
     },
     "text": "Is when the app will take an order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t6",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "1cd5e3b3-4adf-89d2-b8a1-ba35fe69754d"
     },
     "text": "Why Teams Compare"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t7",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8be"
     },
     "text": "What people mean by an alternative to NECS Entree"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t8",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8c2"
     },
     "text": "Almost nobody searching for a NECS Entree alternative wants to tear out four decades of distribution software. They want one part of the day to get better, and it is usually how an order gets to you. Three cases come up, and only the last one is really a NECS Entree competitor question."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t9",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "eb7fd825-30c6-7275-9a2f-c98f68eb960f"
     },
     "text": "Ordering still means someone typing"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t10",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8cc"
     },
     "text": "Entree already offers customer ordering on web and mobile, and both have the person ordering type quantities after a search. Plenty of kitchens never take to that at the end of a shift, so the orders carry on coming by phone and your desk keys them anyway."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t11",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "bacfcf90-d337-55e1-9a02-49b2f6962e16"
     },
     "text": "Ordering lives inside the ERP"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t12",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8d3"
     },
     "text": "Entree's own ordering tools live inside the software that runs your company, which suits the accounts who use them. Our app gives your other accounts a simple voice option and leaves every Entree module where it is."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t13",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "83921d0d-4ec1-911e-4420-fee5bfd13614"
     },
     "text": "Actually replacing it is a different project"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t14",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8da"
     },
     "text": "If your real plan is to move off Entree entirely, remember that your whole back office moves with it. That is an ERP selection, not what we do, and we would rather tell you now than sit through the wrong demo with you."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t15",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "f5b08e4d-7503-2dae-cdd2-6f455d9fe83d"
     },
     "text": "What a NECS Entree alternative changes, and what it leaves alone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t16",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "f49b7c29-2a8e-b047-d714-742b52e0a34c"
     },
     "text": "What You Get"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t17",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "d4031fde-2fc3-b283-bb1c-784e741d725b"
     },
     "text": "Voice Ordering"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t18",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0ed"
     },
     "text": "Say what is low, check it, send it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t19",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0f1"
     },
     "text": "A chef counts what is low and says it. Items come up as a list from their own guide, they fix anything wrong, and they send. For the accounts who never warmed to a web order form, that is a much shorter job."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t20",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4133"
     },
     "text": "The kitchen's buyer checks the list before anything leaves"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t21",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4139"
     },
     "text": "Spoken from the cooler or the bench, at any hour"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t22",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe413f"
     },
     "text": "Saves 20 to 30 minutes compared with the same order by phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t23",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4145"
     },
     "text": "Interrupted halfway? It holds the order until they come back"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t24",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "d5d6538b-4114-51aa-7fff-aad875b7bfe3"
     },
     "text": "Order Guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t25",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea2"
     },
     "text": "Built from the lists you already maintain"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t26",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea6"
     },
     "text": "Export what you have. We load each account's items under your codes at the price you set for them, and setup is done. Nothing inside your distribution software is touched to make it work."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t27",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdead"
     },
     "text": "A kitchen sees nothing but the lines it buys"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t28",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb3"
     },
     "text": "Pricing and the catalog remain yours to set"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t29",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb9"
     },
     "text": "Change a guide once and every later order uses it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t30",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdebf"
     },
     "text": "No Entree module to add or upgrade"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t31",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "6555f9fc-4dcc-b940-f384-6001ce4db69f"
     },
     "text": "Delivery Formats"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t32",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb118"
     },
     "text": "It arrives in the formats your system already takes"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t33",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb11c"
     },
     "text": "A finished order leaves as an email carrying a PDF, Excel or Word file, or goes straight in over the API, over EDI, or into QuickBooks. Whichever route your office already trusts is the one it uses."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t34",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb123"
     },
     "text": "Addressed to a rep, or to the purchasing desk"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t35",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb129"
     },
     "text": "Over EDI, the API or QuickBooks, nobody on your team retypes it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t36",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb12f"
     },
     "text": "Picking, billing and delivery carry on unchanged"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t37",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb135"
     },
     "text": "You do not have to remove any software first"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t38",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "099f67ce-06ef-dc92-c6e6-fdc4481f359f"
     },
     "text": "Inventory Visibility"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t39",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93a"
     },
     "text": "Stock in view as each order lands"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t40",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93e"
     },
     "text": "VoiceOrder Solutions carries real-time inventory visibility tied to what is being ordered, and the catalog updates as stock levels change. It does not replace your stock system: that stays in charge, and a demo shows how the levels connect."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t41",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df945"
     },
     "text": "Every line you carry, not only the quick movers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t42",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df94b"
     },
     "text": "Fewer stockout surprises on a late, heavy order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t43",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df951"
     },
     "text": "Stock numbers come from the system you count with today"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t44",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df957"
     },
     "text": "No stock is counted on our side"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t45",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "021e8cc1-41f6-a5cc-3995-2a8c101d005c"
     },
     "text": "Side By Side"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t46",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64e7"
     },
     "text": "How Entree and VoiceOrder Solutions share the day"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t47",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64ec"
     },
     "text": "Keeping the ERP is the normal case with us, not the exception. We are not a NECS Entree replacement, just a way for orders to get in, on a system you keep exactly as it is."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t48",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da6507"
     },
     "text": "Your records stay where they are"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t49",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da650a"
     },
     "text": "Every number your business runs on keeps living where it lives. We pass the order across and leave your own records alone."
    }
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "label": "t50",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a6d"
     },
     "text": "Keep Entree's web ordering for the accounts that like it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t51",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a70"
     },
     "text": "Buyers who happily work through Entree's screens can carry on. Our app is for the accounts that never used them and still phone in. Calls you keep taking get no order number from us; only what comes through the app does."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t52",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535624"
     },
     "text": "Entree upgrades go ahead without us"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t53",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535627"
     },
     "text": "Because we sit outside Entree, you can upgrade it whenever you like. We never hold up an upgrade, and an upgrade never holds us up."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t54",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b4"
     },
     "text": "See a voice order arrive next to your ERP"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t55",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b8"
     },
     "text": "Twenty minutes. A kitchen's buyer talks, and you see the approved order turn up."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t56",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "6923bf1d-5310-eba9-bcb8-7266c5f85e97"
     },
     "text": "Getting Started"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t57",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ec7"
     },
     "text": "Three steps, and nothing inside Entree changes"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t58",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "38293a1d-fb4c-9501-8014-28855f9128b6"
     },
     "text": "You export lists, we set up the accounts, and kitchens begin sending orders."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t59",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ed6"
     },
     "text": "Export your lists"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t60",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5eda"
     },
     "text": "A spreadsheet out of the system you have is plenty. Items and prices per account go into a single admin screen under the codes you use."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t61",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ede"
     },
     "text": "We set up each account"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t62",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ee3"
     },
     "text": "We load each guide and set the account up, then the kitchen downloads the app. Most send something in before the day is out."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t63",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f00"
     },
     "text": "The order lands finished"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t64",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f04"
     },
     "text": "The customer has approved it, and it carries an order number and the time it was sent, in the format your system takes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t65",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a176"
     },
     "text": "Entree plus VoiceOrder Solutions."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t66",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "0c6cf9c7-bbe3-a64d-76b9-1539a90ac7c8"
     },
     "text": "Your ERP keeps the books."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t67",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "7b8acd63-aca8-b070-4eb6-f64ce47abebc"
     },
     "text": "Keep, Then Add"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t68",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a179"
     },
     "text": "Extra ways to order should leave your main system alone, so this table only adds. Entree has been food distribution software since 1987. It runs the accounting, the warehouse and the EDI, which is why a NECS Entree alternative is rarely a like-for-like swap. The left column is your operation with both; the two products do not connect."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t69",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "1ff87819-9b94-6168-dfbb-e81fd6a5b236"
     },
     "text": "Feature"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t70",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a18d"
     },
     "text": "Entree + VoiceOrder Solutions"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t71",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a19e"
     },
     "text": "Entree on its own"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t72",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1be"
     },
     "text": "Accounting, ledger and payables"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t73",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1c8"
     },
     "text": "Kitchens order by voice and approve each line"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t74",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1d5"
     },
     "text": "Warehouse management and a delivery app"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t75",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1e2"
     },
     "text": "Each account has its own guide, at your prices"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t76",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1ec"
     },
     "text": "Self-service order entry for customers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t77",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1f6"
     },
     "text": "Tablet ordering for sales reps"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t78",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a210"
     },
     "text": "EDI run from inside your ERP"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t79",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a21a"
     },
     "text": "Reports and dashboards on the whole business"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t80",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a224"
     },
     "text": "A new ordering step, set up from an export"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t81",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "30f8c397-6bf9-f190-2eb1-183dc2b44d9e"
     },
     "text": "FAQ"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t82",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf956"
     },
     "text": "Questions from distributors keeping their ERP"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t83",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "8bf0eb84-6a8d-dd56-6a0e-8116d9416d3d"
     },
     "text": "Do we need a NECS Entree alternative so accounts can speak what they need?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t84",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf967"
     },
     "text": "No, and we would rather lead with that. Entree is the software your company runs on; VoiceOrder Solutions handles how an order gets in. Keep the first, add the second, and the real question becomes which part of the day you are trying to fix."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t85",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "ad9f0390-a776-7031-a95b-984cd1988c9e"
     },
     "text": "Is VoiceOrder Solutions better than NECS Entree?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t86",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf973"
     },
     "text": "At getting an order out of a kitchen that will not use an order form, yes. At everything else Entree does, the question does not apply. We have no ledger, no payables, no warehouse module and no proof of delivery, which is exactly why we belong next to it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t87",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "e219e293-819b-221b-6d80-7f8d2898a4d7"
     },
     "text": "Doesn't Entree already have customer ordering?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t88",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf97f"
     },
     "text": "It does. They offer web order entry and mobile order entry, plus a rep order pad. All of it works by a person finding items and typing quantities. The accounts who were never going to do that are the ones our app is for."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t89",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "39590628-381c-9aea-6095-0746f7348939"
     },
     "text": "Is Entree hooked up to VoiceOrder Solutions?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t90",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf98b"
     },
     "text": "No. Nothing links the two products, and neither vendor supports the other. Our orders leave in the formats shown above. Which of those your Entree setup can take in directly is something to check in the demo. We do not promise it here."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t91",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "0f73d180-08e9-596f-f264-a95de40f9593"
     },
     "text": "Will this touch our installation or our version?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t92",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "7e541655-5a68-8f96-1273-8249a5c759bd"
     },
     "text": "No. We never need a login to your Entree system to set this up. We work from an export of your item lists, and orders arrive as an email attachment or over EDI or the API. Your version, your upgrade schedule and your support arrangement are all unaffected."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t93",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "d9956fbb-a3d6-4b04-b3ab-98b6f5ae509f"
     },
     "text": "How fast could this be live?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t94",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "4446ea80-4c7a-f2a8-f0de-0a222818c94f"
     },
     "text": "For most distributors this goes live inside 24 to 48 hours, and most kitchens get a first order in that day. There is no project here, because nothing in Entree is connected or changed. So adding a step beside it asks far less of you than a NECS Entree alternative that replaces the ERP."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t95",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "93ba65b0-4eb0-c64e-d0c0-933cd7a92b1d"
     },
     "text": "How do the costs compare?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t96",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf997"
     },
     "text": "Neither of us publishes figures. We quote per distributor. Since Entree stays, the decision is only what we cost on top of it. That is a far narrower call than choosing the platform the whole company depends on."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t97",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-990427524516"
     },
     "text": "Where do the Entree details on this page come from?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t98",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a5bdafc7a7656fa9b4c",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-99042752451e"
     },
     "text": "Read off necs.com on 10 October 2026: the module list, the 1987 founding date and the web, mobile and rep ordering products. They publish no price and no implementation process, so this page guesses at neither. If any detail is now out of date, that error is ours."
    }
   }
  ]
 ],
